  "notes": "{背|せ} refers to height/stature or the back of the body.\n\nHEIGHT EXPRESSIONS:\n- {背|せ}が{高|たか}い: tall\n- {背|せ}が{低|ひく}い: short\n- {背|せ}が{伸|の}びる: to grow taller\n- {背|せ}の{順|じゅん}: in order of height\n\nBACK EXPRESSIONS:\n- {背中|せなか}: back (of body) - most common\n- {背|せ}を{向|む}ける: to turn one's back\n- {背|せ}を{伸|の}ばす: to straighten one's back\n- {背|せ}を{押|お}す: to push from behind; to encourage\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {身長|しんちょう}: height (formal measurement)\n- {背丈|せたけ}: stature, height\n- {背骨|せぼね}: spine, backbone\n\nIDIOM:\n{背|せ}に{腹|はら}は{代|か}えられない: necessity knows no law",
